          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Spiritu yaYehova hakunfumisha heseki, hakuntwala kwiwulu, hakuntwala kuchisu chakwitala daYehova chakumusela, chochatalakumusela. Kutala kuwiŋililu wakuchisu kudi amayala makumi ayedi natanu. Mukachi kawu hinukumonamu mwana kaAzuri Yazaniya, nimwana kaBenaya Pelatiya, atulamba twawantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuŋila nindi, Eyi mwana kamuntu, wenawa diwu antu adi nakukasakasa yakuluwa, adi nakuleja akwawu mpùŋa yatama mumukaliwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diwu elaŋa nawu, Hakutuŋila matala kanda. Nawu, Mukaliwu hiinuŋu, etu yetu mbiji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi eyi mwana kamuntu, profwetaku nsaŋu jakuyizuwila, profwetaŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Spiritu yaYehova hakuholokela hadami, hakuŋila nindi, Hoshaku neyi, Yehova nahoshi nindi, Enu akwamutaŋa waIsarela munahoshi dehi mwenimu; muloŋa ami neluka yuma yenzaŋa munyichima yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwenu munajahajahi munayivulishi mumukaliwu, munyikwakwa munenzeshumu akwenu munajahajahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Mwanta Yehova nahoshi nindi, Akwenu munajahajahi munalumbeki mukachi kamukala, diwu anekali mbiji, mukaliwu diyi inuŋu; hakwila enu aweni akayifumishamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu mwatiyili woma wampoku yakabali, ami nakayiletela yoyi mpoku yakabali. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Mwanta Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami nakayifumishamu, nakayihana kudi antu akumatuŋa acheŋi, nakayikoŋa mwomwayisompesheleluwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakadimbuka nampoku yakabali. Nakayisompesha muŋinza yaIsarela. Himwakeluka nenu yami Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukaliwu hiwakekala inuŋu yenuku, ninenu himwakekala mbiji yidumuku. Nakayisompesha muŋinza yaIsarela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakeluka nenu yami Yehova. Muloŋa enu himunendi munshimbi jamuku. Himunakoŋi mwaya wuŋaji wamuku, ilaŋa munakoŋi mwaya yijila yanyuza yayinyeŋumuka kwi-ndo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinelili nidi nakuprofweta, mwana kaBenaya Pelatiya hakufwa. Hinukudimbuka chamesu ami heseki, hinukubilela nezu deneni, nami, Ala Mwanta Yehova! Keŋa wumanishi aIsarela anashaluku, tahindi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izu daYehova hidikwinza kudami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Eyi mwana kamuntu, ana kweyi, wowu ana kweyeyi, wowu awusoku weyeyi aweni, niakwamutaŋa waIsarela wejima wawu, diwu aneluwu kudi ekala kuYerusalema, nawu, Fumenu kudi Yehova muyi kwakulehi nayena. Ituŋiidi anatwinkidu diikali detu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi hoshaku neyi, Mwanta Yehova nahoshi nindi, Hela nayifumisha dehi kunu nakuyitwala kwakulehi mwahita nyuza, hela nayiŋalaŋesha dehi mwahita matuŋa, hela chochu, kudi wena ami nekali malalawu kapinji kantesha mumatuŋa mwayawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi hoshaku neyi, Mwanta Yehova nahoshi nindi, Nakayipompesha nakuyifumisha munyuza yawantu, nakayikumaŋeja, nakuyifumisha mumatuŋa mwayiŋalaŋesheleluwu, nakayinka ituŋa daIsarela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akenza kwenoku, akafumishaku yuma yawunyeŋu yejima yiduku, niyishimashima yejima yiduku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakayinka wena muchima wumu, nakasha spiritu yayiha mudenu. Nakafumisha muchima welola mumujimba wawu, nakayinka muchima wamusunyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kulonda akendaŋa munshimbi jami, akahembaŋa mwaya yiyulu yami, akelaŋamu. Hiyakekala antu ami, ninami nakekala Nzambi yawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila akweti muchima wayaloŋa mwaya yuma yawu yawunyeŋu niyishimashima yawu, nakayiletela hanyitu yawu yuma yawu yelaŋawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dimu mwanahoshiyi Mwanta Yehova. Akerubi anyamuna nimpuula jawu, tufumbu saŋa tudi kumbavu jawu. Kulema kwaNzambi yaIsarela kudi hewulu dawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulema kwaYehova hikukunyamuka mukachi kamukala, hikukuya nakwimana hampidi yidi kumbadi yamukala yakumusela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Spiritu hakunnyamuna kwiwulu, hakuntwala kuKaladeya kudi ayili muwukoli, antweli muchimwenu, chakuntwala kudi Spiritu yaNzambi. Chimwenu ochu chinamweni hichikunyamuka kwiwulu, hichikunfuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukuleja atweluwu muwukoli yuma yejima yanmwekesheleliyi Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
